From: itskenny0 <0@kenny.cat>
Subject: [PATCH] Include algorithm for volume label replacement

PublicVolume uses std::replace for ISO9660/UDF labels. Include its defining
header instead of relying on transitive standard-library includes.

---
--- a/model/PublicVolume.cpp
+++ b/model/PublicVolume.cpp
@@ -32,6 +32,8 @@
 #include <cutils/fs.h>
 #include <private/android_filesystem_config.h>
 #include <utils/Timers.h>
+
+#include <algorithm>
 
 #include <fcntl.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
